{"id":"0716e09b34db523d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-small-ordinal-code.md","title":"Finite Codes for Ordinals below Omega to the Omega","display":"df-small-ordinal-code — Finite Codes for Ordinals below Omega to the Omega","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-small-ordinal-code","aliases":["89-df-small-ordinal-code"],"display":"df-small-ordinal-code — Finite Codes for Ordinals below Omega to the Omega","depends_on":[],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-small-ordinal-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-small-ordinal-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-small-ordinal-code — Finite Codes for Ordinals below Omega to the Omega"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在序数码运算中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,s,t\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(\\alpha,s,t\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\omega\">\\(j\\in\\omega\\)</span>；扩展比较的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\infty\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\infty\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为自然数有限序列集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|\">\\(|s|\\)</span> 为序列长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(k)\">\\(s(k)\\)</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 项，位置从 0 起计。</li>\n<li>有限序列用函数图编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty=\\omega\">\\(\\infty=\\omega\\)</span> 是不属于任何有限序列集的额外标记。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}small\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\n\\forall k\\ (k+1&lt;|s|\\to s(k)\\ge s(k+1))\\},\\\\\n0_{\\mathcal O}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\widehat n\\coloneqq\\langle0\\mid k&lt;n\\rangle\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\ns&lt;_{\\mathcal O}t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(|s|&lt;|t|\\land\\forall k&lt;|s|\\ s(k)=t(k))\\lor\n\\exists k&lt;\\min(|s|,|t|)\\\n[(\\forall h&lt;k\\ s(h)=t(h))\\land s(k)&lt;t(k)],\\\\\n\\mathcal O_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal O\\cup\\{\\infty\\},\\qquad\ns&lt;_{\\mathcal O_\\infty}t\\Longleftrightarrow\n(s,t\\in\\mathcal O\\land s&lt;_{\\mathcal O}t)\\lor(s\\in\\mathcal O\\land t=\\infty),\\\\\n\\alpha^-&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\max(|\\alpha|-1,0),\\qquad\n\\alpha+1\\coloneqq\\alpha\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\\\\nd\\alpha&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha(|\\alpha|-1)\\quad(\\alpha\\ne0_{\\mathcal O}),\\qquad\nd0_{\\mathcal O}=d\\infty\\coloneqq\\infty,\\\\\n\\alpha^{-j}&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha\\upharpoonright\n|\\{k&lt;|\\alpha|\\mid\\alpha(k)\\ge j\\}|,\\qquad\n\\alpha^{+j}\\coloneqq\\alpha^{-j}\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle j\\rangle\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O,\\ j\\in\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}small\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\n\\forall k\\ (k+1&lt;|s|\\to s(k)\\ge s(k+1))\\},\\\\\n0_{\\mathcal O}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\widehat n\\coloneqq\\langle0\\mid k&lt;n\\rangle\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\ns&lt;_{\\mathcal O}t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(|s|&lt;|t|\\land\\forall k&lt;|s|\\ s(k)=t(k))\\lor\n\\exists k&lt;\\min(|s|,|t|)\\\n[(\\forall h&lt;k\\ s(h)=t(h))\\land s(k)&lt;t(k)],\\\\\n\\mathcal O_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal O\\cup\\{\\infty\\},\\qquad\ns&lt;_{\\mathcal O_\\infty}t\\Longleftrightarrow\n(s,t\\in\\mathcal O\\land s&lt;_{\\mathcal O}t)\\lor(s\\in\\mathcal O\\land t=\\infty),\\\\\n\\alpha^-&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\max(|\\alpha|-1,0),\\qquad\n\\alpha+1\\coloneqq\\alpha\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\\\\nd\\alpha&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha(|\\alpha|-1)\\quad(\\alpha\\ne0_{\\mathcal O}),\\qquad\nd0_{\\mathcal O}=d\\infty\\coloneqq\\infty,\\\\\n\\alpha^{-j}&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha\\upharpoonright\n|\\{k&lt;|\\alpha|\\mid\\alpha(k)\\ge j\\}|,\\qquad\n\\alpha^{+j}\\coloneqq\\alpha^{-j}\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle j\\rangle\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O,\\ j\\in\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.212–213、215。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>“真前缀”可展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|&lt;|t|\\land\\forall k&lt;|s|\\ s(k)=t(k)\">\\(|s|&lt;|t|\\land\\forall k&lt;|s|\\ s(k)=t(k)\\)</span>。扩展顺序在有限码上保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathcal O}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathcal O}\\)</span>，标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 大于全部有限码。后文省略顺序下标，并把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{\\mathcal O}\">\\(0_{\\mathcal O}\\)</span> 写作 0。</p>\n<p>码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle l_1,\\ldots,l_m\\rangle\">\\(\\langle l_1,\\ldots,l_m\\rangle\\)</span> 对应标准序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{l_1}+\\cdots+\\omega^{l_m}&lt;\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^{l_1}+\\cdots+\\omega^{l_m}&lt;\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；这里指数非增，允许重复，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1,1\\rangle\">\\(\\langle1,1\\rangle\\)</span> 编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\cdot2\">\\(\\omega\\cdot2\\)</span>。本目录只用有限码操作，未把标准序数基础伪装成新的未定义函数。</p>\n<p>截断保留所有 <strong>大于或等于</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的指数，随后添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>；这对应原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^{-j}\">\\(\\alpha^{-j}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^{+j}=\\alpha^{-j}+\\omega^j\">\\(\\alpha^{+j}=\\alpha^{-j}+\\omega^j\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 只是正规形的边界标记，不产生无限长公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,s,t\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"|s|","display":false},{"tex":"s(k)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}small\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O&\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\\mid\n\\forall k\\ (k+1<|s|\\to s(k)\\ge s(k+1))\\},\\\\\n0_{\\mathcal O}&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\widehat n\\coloneqq\\langle0\\mid k<n\\rangle\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\ns<_{\\mathcal O}t&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(|s|<|t|\\land\\forall k<|s|\\ s(k)=t(k))\\lor\n\\exists k<\\min(|s|,|t|)\\\n[(\\forall h<k\\ s(h)=t(h))\\land s(k)<t(k)],\\\\\n\\mathcal O_\\infty&\\coloneqq\\mathcal O\\cup\\{\\infty\\},\\qquad\ns<_{\\mathcal O_\\infty}t\\Longleftrightarrow\n(s,t\\in\\mathcal O\\land s<_{\\mathcal O}t)\\lor(s\\in\\mathcal O\\land t=\\infty),\\\\\n\\alpha^-&\\coloneqq\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\max(|\\alpha|-1,0),\\qquad\n\\alpha+1\\coloneqq\\alpha\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\\\\nd\\alpha&\\coloneqq\\alpha(|\\alpha|-1)\\quad(\\alpha\\ne0_{\\mathcal O}),\\qquad\nd0_{\\mathcal O}=d\\infty\\coloneqq\\infty,\\\\\n\\alpha^{-j}&\\coloneqq\\alpha\\upharpoonright\n|\\{k<|\\alpha|\\mid\\alpha(k)\\ge j\\}|,\\qquad\n\\alpha^{+j}\\coloneqq\\alpha^{-j}\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle j\\rangle\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O,\\ j\\in\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"|s|<|t|\\land\\forall k<|s|\\ s(k)=t(k)","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathcal O}","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"0_{\\mathcal O}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle l_1,\\ldots,l_m\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^{l_1}+\\cdots+\\omega^{l_m}<\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle1,1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\cdot2","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha^{-j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha^{+j}=\\alpha^{-j}+\\omega^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":2713,"backlinks":[{"id":"8de2ffea9eb2c928","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b21577b9c610fde4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"序数与公式：[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]] → [[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]] → [[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]] → [[89-lem-glb-box-absorption]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}